   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Confirm the scaffold. Engine with tests\nfirst. Geo data for 4 hubs. Local store +\ngenerator. Ops console, rider phone\nframe and customer panel in Demo\nmode.\n\nDone when: npm test is green, calibration\nhits 17% overall and about 40% in the top\n20%, and Start day flags orders on the\nmap.",
