   "text": "Live round trip on a team phone. /desk\nand /pilot finished. Vercel deploy.\nLanding page. Code + security review of\n/api and the webhook. e2e test. Record\nthe 90 s video. Screenshots and QR\ncodes to the deck teammate.\n\nDone when: all 6 routes work on the\ndeployed URL.",
